# The vendored SDK is reference material for agents and humans. It must never
# enter the image: it is not a build input, and shipping ~2.7 MB of somebody
# else's source in a runtime image is both waste and a licence question.
repos/

# Dev-only
.prompts/
.vscode/
.github/
docs/
test/
scripts/
**/*.md
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Build noise
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
coverage
*.tgz
